    "friction": [
      "Had to verify manually whether the wasm .d.ts file with the stale doc comment was tracked source or generated output before deciding no action was needed.",
      "Crypto-privacy review took ~4 minutes (81,946 tokens, 22 tool uses) — much heavier than the security review, so the two agents finished at very different times."
