    "open_items": [
      "Add the two cheap one-line row-level test assertions recommended by the crypto review (RevocationSignal and EpochLag cases at facade.rs:18757 and facade.rs:18425) before pushing.",
      "Record the writable_scope_refs (accept.rs:282) constraint so any future caller uses live_permission instead of the stale bookmark copy.",
